## Next Steps:
Once deployed to Vercel, Speed Insights will automatically start collecting performance metrics. You can view the data in your Vercel dashboard under the Speed Insights section.

Note: The project already had @vercel/analytics installed, so Speed Insights complements the existing analytics setup.
